<div class="xsto-container py-8 md:py-12 "><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage","name":"XSTO Delivery Information","description":"Delivery methods for XSTO powered wheelchairs and accessories from Bentech Medical Ltd."}</script><section class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border bg-gradient-navy text-white"><div class="px-5 py-8 sm:px-8 md:px-10 md:py-12"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-white/70">UK &amp; Ireland fulfilment</p><h1 class="max-w-2xl font-display text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white md:text-4xl">Delivery information</h1><p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80 md:text-lg">Full-size chairs arrive on a pallet. Accessories ship by courier. In selected areas we can arrange engineer delivery and setup — contact us to check your postcode.</p><div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3"><a href="/collections/all" class="btn-checkout inline-flex h-11 items-center px-5">Shop the range</a><a href="/pages/contact" class="inline-flex h-11 items-center rounded-lg border border-white/30 bg-white/5 px-5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10">Check your postcode</a></div></div></section><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mt-5 text-xs text-muted-foreground"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><li><a href="/" class="hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li aria-hidden="true">/</li><li aria-current="page" class="font-medium text-foreground">Delivery</li></ol></nav><section aria-labelledby="delivery-methods-heading" class="mt-12"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl" id="delivery-methods-heading">How we deliver</h2><ul class="mt-8 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-truck size-6 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14 18V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v11a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2" /> <path d="M15 18H9" /> <path d="M19 18h2a1 1 0 0 0 1-1v-3.65a1 1 0 0 0-.22-.624l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14" /> <circle cx="17" cy="18" r="2" /> <circle cx="7" cy="18" r="2" /></svg><h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Pallet delivery</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Full-size powered wheelchairs are delivered on a pallet by a specialist freight carrier.</p><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Typical for M4, M4 Pro, M4B and X12 orders.</li><li>Kerbside or nearest safe point delivery — the driver will not carry the chair upstairs.</li><li>You will need clear access (path, doorway width) and someone available to accept delivery.</li><li>The chair remains secured on the pallet until you are ready to unpack and inspect it.</li></ul></li><li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-package size-6 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z" /> <path d="M12 22V12" /> <polyline points="3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7" /> <path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15" /></svg><h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Courier delivery</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Smaller items — accessories, batteries, chargers and spare parts — ship by parcel courier.</p><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Usually dispatched within 1–2 working days when in stock.</li><li>Standard parcel service with tracking emailed after dispatch.</li><li>UK mainland: £10 shipping on orders under £100; free from £100.</li><li>May be combined with a chair order or purchased separately.</li></ul></li><li class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-6"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench size-6 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z" /></svg><h3 class="mt-4 text-lg font-semibold text-foreground">Engineer delivery &amp; setup</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">In selected UK mainland areas we can arrange an engineer to deliver, unpack and set up your chair.</p><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"><li>Includes basic setup, safety checks and a handover of controls — subject to availability.</li><li>Not available in all postcodes. Contact us with your delivery postcode before ordering.</li><li>May incur an additional fee depending on location and model — we will confirm in writing.</li><li>Engineer delivery must be booked in advance; it is not automatically included with pallet delivery.</li></ul></li></ul></section><section aria-labelledby="delivery-steps-heading" class="mt-14"><h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground md:text-3xl" id="delivery-steps-heading">From order to doorstep</h2><ol class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><li><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Step 1</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-foreground">Order confirmed</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">You receive an order confirmation by email. Pre-order items show an estimated dispatch window on the product page.</p></li><li><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Step 2</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-foreground">Dispatch &amp; tracking</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">When your order leaves our warehouse we email tracking details (courier or pallet carrier as applicable).</p></li><li><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Step 3</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-foreground">Delivery day</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">The carrier will contact you where possible to arrange a delivery window. Someone aged 18+ must be present to sign.</p></li><li><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold">Step 4</p><p class="mt-2 font-semibold text-foreground">Inspect on arrival</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Check the packaging and product before signing. Report visible damage within 48 hours — see our delivery terms below.</p></li></ol></section><section aria-labelledby="delivery-regions-heading" class="mt-14 border-y border-border py-8"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground" id="delivery-regions-heading">Where we deliver</h2><dl class="mt-6 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><dt class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin size-4 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" /> <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg>UK mainland</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Free delivery on orders of £100 or more (all XSTO chairs qualify). Orders under £100: £10 UK mainland shipping. M4, M4B and M4 Pro typically 3–4 working days; other in-stock models 5–7 working days.</dd></div><div><dt class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin size-4 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" /> <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg>Scottish Highlands &amp; islands</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Delivered by pallet or courier. Extended lead times may apply — contact us for a quote before ordering.</dd></div><div><dt class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin size-4 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" /> <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg>Northern Ireland</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Delivered subject to carrier availability. Contact us for timescales and any surcharges.</dd></div><div><dt class="flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-foreground"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-map-pin size-4 text-navy" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0" /> <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" /></svg>Republic of Ireland</dt><dd class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Available on request. Duties, customs and delivery charges quoted separately.</dd></div></dl></section><section aria-labelledby="delivery-arrival-heading" class="mt-12"><h2 class="font-display text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-foreground" id="delivery-arrival-heading">On delivery day</h2><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground"><li>Check the outer packaging for damage before signing — note any issues on the carrier’s paperwork.</li><li>Photograph damage to packaging and product if visible.</li><li>Report transit damage to sales@bentechmeduk.com within 48 hours with photos and your order number.</li><li>Retain all packaging until you are satisfied the product is correct and undamaged.</li><li>Do not register your warranty or use the chair outdoors until you are sure you are keeping it.</li></ul><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Need to return an item? See our <a href="/pages/returns" class="font-medium text-gold hover:text-gold-dark">returns policy</a>.</p></section><div class="mt-14"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[220px_1fr]"><nav aria-label="Table of contents" class="hidden lg:block"><p class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">On this page</p><ul class="sticky top-24 space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#lead-times">Lead times</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#access">Access &amp; site requirements</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#failed-delivery">Failed or refused delivery</a></li><li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-gold" href="#vat-preorder">VAT relief &amp; pre-orders</a></li></ul></nav><div class="min-w-0 space-y-10"><section id="lead-times"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Lead times</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>In-stock M4, M4B and M4 Pro typically deliver within 3–4 working days to UK mainland addresses. X12 typically arrives in 10 days. Other in-stock models usually arrive within 5–7 working days.</p><p>X12 accessories are on a ~4 week pre-order / backorder — you can still buy them today. Mixed orders follow the longest lead time for each item; the chair still ships on its usual ETA when accessories are backordered.</p></div></section><section id="access"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Access &amp; site requirements</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>Pallet deliveries require suitable vehicle access. Narrow lanes, steep drives or blocks to the delivery point must be disclosed when ordering.</p><p>Standard doorways and paths must accommodate the packed chair dimensions. If access is restricted, contact us before ordering — engineer delivery may be appropriate in some areas.</p></div></section><section id="failed-delivery"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">Failed or refused delivery</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>If delivery cannot be completed due to failed access, nobody present to sign, or refusal at the door, redelivery or storage charges may apply.</p><p>Refusing delivery without contacting us first may affect your statutory cancellation rights — please speak to us if you have concerns before the carrier arrives.</p></div></section><section id="vat-preorder"><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-foreground">VAT relief &amp; pre-orders</h2><div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-muted-foreground"><p>VAT relief is applied at checkout when you declare eligibility. Pre-order deposits and balance payments are due as stated on the product page before dispatch.</p></div></section></div></div></div></div>
